CAUSE CLASSIFICATION AND MINIMAL AUTHOR RECOMMENDATION

Established: mixed whole-consumer RSS accounting includes resident fixture baseline;
the original assertion loses its numeric telemetry; the stream code uses awaited,
bounded fragments with no identified unbounded stdout retention. Prior process
lifetime high-water inclusion is ruled out as the metric mechanism. Concurrent
external process RSS summation is ruled out. Co-resident fixture/allocator footprint
is a plausible contributor but NOT established as the old threshold-crossing cause.
Historical cause remains genuinely UNDETERMINED because the numeric measurement,
baseline and memory breakdown were discarded/not captured. This single fresh
probe provides no evidence that requires a behavioral stream implementation fix.

